OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA rather windy day with brisk
OL,6,Fsoutherly winds and periods of rain,
OL,7,Fheavy at times, erratically edging
OL,8,Fsouthwards. Southern parts of the
OL,9,Fregion may remain largely dry until
OL,10,Fthe evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FOvernight rain clearing the south then
OL,14,Fbright with sunny spells on Saturday
OL,15,Fwith lighter winds. Fine more most on
OL,16,FSunday then cloudier on Monday with
OL,17,Fpatchy rain. Turning windier again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
